{"id":"5b66d1b59b418b03","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-time-average.md","title":"Birkhoff Time Average","display":"df-time-average — Birkhoff Time Average","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-time-average","aliases":["58-df-time-average","Time Average"],"display":"df-time-average — Birkhoff Time Average","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-conditional-expectation.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-time-average"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-time-average</span><span>Time Average</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-time-average — Birkhoff Time Average"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"785c80475c01fc69\" href=\"?note=785c80475c01fc69\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md\">../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"52ad543842bcb570\" href=\"?note=52ad543842bcb570\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-conditional-expectation.md\">../batch02/58-df-conditional-expectation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,T,f,A,\\mathcal I,g\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,T,f,A,\\mathcal I,g\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are the predicates from the cited dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InvariantSigmaAlgebra}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{InvariantSigmaAlgebra}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TimeAverageSequence}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TimeAverageSequence}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> are defined below.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}time\\text{-}average\\text{-}invariant\\text{-}sigma}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InvariantSigmaAlgebra}_S(\\mathcal I,T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\n\\mathcal I=\\{B\\in\\mathcal F:\\mu(B\\mathbin\\triangle T^{-1}[B])=0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}time\\text{-}average\\text{-}invariant\\text{-}sigma}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InvariantSigmaAlgebra}_S(\\mathcal I,T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\n\\mathcal I=\\{B\\in\\mathcal F:\\mu(B\\mathbin\\triangle T^{-1}[B])=0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}time\\text{-}average\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TimeAverageSequence}_S(A,f,T,X)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(A,\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\mathbb R^X)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\left(A(n)(x)=\\frac1n\\sum_{k&lt;n}f(T^k(x))\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}time\\text{-}average\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TimeAverageSequence}_S(A,f,T,X)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(A,\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\mathbb R^X)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\left(A(n)(x)=\\frac1n\\sum_{k&lt;n}f(T^k(x))\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}time\\text{-}average\\text{-}birkhoff}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{InvariantSigmaAlgebra}_S(\\mathcal I,T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{TimeAverageSequence}_S(A,f,T,X)\n\\land\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(g,f,\\mathcal I,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;\n\\exists N\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mu(N)=0\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\setminus N\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}{}\\bigl(n\\geq n_0\\land n\\neq0\n\\to |A(n)(x)-g(x)|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}time\\text{-}average\\text{-}birkhoff}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{InvariantSigmaAlgebra}_S(\\mathcal I,T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{TimeAverageSequence}_S(A,f,T,X)\n\\land\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(g,f,\\mathcal I,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;\n\\exists N\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mu(N)=0\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\setminus N\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}{}\\bigl(n\\geq n_0\\land n\\neq0\n\\to |A(n)(x)-g(x)|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}time\\text{-}average\\text{-}ergodic}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{TimeAverageSequence}_S(A,f,T,X)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists g\\in V\\;\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(g,f,\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;\n\\exists N\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mu(N)=0\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\setminus N\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}{}\\bigl(n\\geq n_0\\land n\\neq0\n\\to |A(n)(x)-\\textstyle\\int_Xf\\,d\\mu|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}time\\text{-}average\\text{-}ergodic}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{TimeAverageSequence}_S(A,f,T,X)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists g\\in V\\;\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(g,f,\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;\n\\exists N\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mu(N)=0\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\setminus N\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}{}\\bigl(n\\geq n_0\\land n\\neq0\n\\to |A(n)(x)-\\textstyle\\int_Xf\\,d\\mu|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Almost-everywhere convergence is expanded into an explicit measurable null set and an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span>--<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_0\">\\(n_0\\)</span> limit clause.</li>\n<li>The corrected argument order is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Conditional expectation supplies the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^1\">\\(L^1\\)</span> hypothesis without introducing a second unsourced integrability predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Walters, An Introduction to Ergodic Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md","status":"resolved","id":"785c80475c01fc69","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-conditional-expectation.md","status":"resolved","id":"52ad543842bcb570","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../bat